# A brass toy wind-up key in the duck's back: the shaft goes down into the back (hidden behind
# the body), the bow stands up above it. windup-key-0..2 turn it: face on, three-quarter, edge on.
# The key is drawn behind the body (the -back frames); the front frames are empty. Back items
# hang on the duck's neck anchor.
name: windup-key
size: 18x15
anchor: neck 17 14
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  G #c99700
  Y #ffd166
  H #fff3b0

